# .trivyignore — suppress specific Trivy findings (one ID per line, no trailing
# comments). Prefer fixing over ignoring. Document every entry with a comment
# line above it saying why and when it can go.
#
# Example:
# # dev-only dependency, fix tracked in TICKET-123
# CVE-2021-23337
# # S3 public access is intentional for the www bucket
# AVD-AWS-0086
